      "english": "The author avoids saying “and the expression” without qualification because that would make the subsequent definition of simple and compound terms apply to meaningless utterances, which are not technical simple terms; likewise signs that have meanings only by natural response or accidental association do not enter the intended conventional verbal classification.",
